# Dubbo serialization security allowlist (P7-RELOCATE).
# The RPC envelope (com.ulticode.common.rpc.RpcResult) and the auth/app
# API DTOs are records that intentionally do not implement
# java.io.Serializable (see MICROSERVICE_MIGRATION_GUIDE §2.6). Without
# this allowlist Dubbo 3.3 strict class checking refuses to
# serialize/deserialize them over hessian2.
com.ulticode.
